Media fit for the studio.

00:16:27.212 --> 00:16:28.664
The Tools

00:16:29.670 --> 00:16:32.708
Think of it like a vending machine for

00:16:32.770 --> 00:16:34.068
design.

00:16:34.855 --> 00:16:38.069
Make a selection, get a result.

00:16:38.844 --> 00:16:40.544
Every time.

00:16:41.304 --> 00:16:44.837
A tool is a ready-to-use creative template

00:16:44.913 --> 00:16:47.555
that knows exactly what it's making and

00:16:47.615 --> 00:16:48.644
how.

00:16:49.410 --> 00:16:52.626
Give it a headline, a date, a number - and

00:16:52.695 --> 00:16:56.219
it produces a finished asset, to spec.

00:16:57.031 --> 00:17:00.193
No design experience needed.

00:17:00.984 --> 00:17:03.748
No decisions about fonts, colors or

00:17:03.810 --> 00:17:06.944
spacing - the tool already knows best.

00:17:07.707 --> 00:17:10.483
Whether you're a designer, a marketer, a

00:17:10.536 --> 00:17:14.039
developer or an AI agent, the output is

00:17:14.097 --> 00:17:15.395
the same.

00:17:16.165 --> 00:17:18.876
Tools are authored once by the people who

00:17:18.936 --> 00:17:22.046
know the brand, and then used by everyone

00:17:22.105 --> 00:17:25.434
else - from a web browser, a phone, the

00:17:25.495 --> 00:17:29.094
command line or an automated pipeline.

00:17:29.872 --> 00:17:33.004
The design decisions are locked in at the

00:17:33.089 --> 00:17:34.694
template level.

00:17:35.464 --> 00:17:38.299
The only thing left to do is fill in the

00:17:38.362 --> 00:17:39.694
content.
